title: questCompleteNode
position: 226,-75
---
<<RemoveItem NPC "apples">>
<<if $hasVisited == true>> //if we have talked to npc and accepted quest 
    <<if $acceptedQuest == true>>
        //has visited and accepted quest
        BOSS: Welcome back!
        BOSS: I see you've brought me what I've asked for! 
        BOSS: Thank you so much!
        //call remove item command
    <<elseif $acceptedQuest == false>>
        BOSS: oh wow ur just a jerk, rejecting me just to do it anyway..
        BOSS: Whatever, thanks for the apples I guess
    <<endif>>
<<else>> //if we have the item and have seen them for the first time before accepting the quest
//similar to intro but then cuts off saying oh have you already picked up the item we've needed? have you just 
// been holding on to it for no reason?? hand it over ill give you something in exchange 
    <<if $acceptedQuest is false>>
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
        BOSS: WHERE ON EARTH HAVE YOU BEEN?
        BOSS: WE'VE BEEN LOOKING FOR YOU ALL DAY? 
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "pc">>
        -> I've been on break
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
            BOSS: We need your help!
            BOSS: I really need some-
            BOSS: Wait you have some apples on you?
            BOSS: Wow thanks for bringing them! I was about to ask for some.
        -> I was lost sorry
            <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
            BOSS: Thats inexcusable! we need your help!
            BOSS: I really need some-
            BOSS: Wait you have some apples on you?
            BOSS: Wow thanks for bringing them! I was about to ask for some.
        -> do you want an apple?
            BOSS: How did you know!
            BOSS: Maybe you are a good employee after all...
            BOSS: thanks!
<<endif>>

<<endif>>
<<if HasItem("oranges")>> //call remove item command here
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
BOSS: I noticed you had some oranges as well..
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "pc">>
    -> yeah what about it?
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
        BOSS: Can I have one?
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "pc">>
            -> no.. sorry I'm really hungry 
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
                BOSS: Aw don't be so stingy.
                <<jump rewardNode>>
            -> sure take one 
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
                BOSS: Wow thanks!
                <<jump rewardNode>>
    -> no I don't
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_RIG "npc">>
        BOSS: Hm. sure.
        <<jump rewardNode>>
<<endif>>
<<jump rewardNode>>
